@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Application error"; }
<div class="section-head"><div><h1>Something went wrong</h1><p class="subheading">AuditFlow could not complete this request. No success should be assumed for the failed operation.</p></div><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index" class="button button-primary">Return to dashboard</a></div>
<div class="card"><p>If this repeats, ask your administrator to inspect the application logs and database connection. Do not retry a financial or stock posting until its final status has been checked.</p></div>
